{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "833cabc5-0a26-80bf-af8e-72bdfc37e2f5",
  "created_at": "2026-03-04T14:39:57-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Nora Doyle",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:33:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recreation Department, this is Beth. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:33:13-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, Beth, good afternoon. My name is Nora Doyle. I am calling because I signed up for a class, and the class, they cancelled it. So I would like my money back, please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:33:28-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I'm sorry about that, Nora. Let's see what we can do. Which class was it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:33:36-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It was the chair yoga, on Tuesday mornings. I paid for the whole session, and then I got a letter that says no more class, not enough people. So now I have the letter and no yoga."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:33:53-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, okay. Yes, that one was folded in with the winter session. Let me pull up your registration. Can you spell your last name for me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:34:05-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Doyle. D, O, Y, L, E. Is a funny name for a Spanish speaker, no? My husband's family is Irish. But I am the one who says it wrong, always."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:34:20-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, it sounds perfect to me. Okay, I've got Nora Doyle here. Chair yoga, Tuesday mornings. I see the note that it was cancelled."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:34:32-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes, that is me. So I can get the refund? I want to confirm I understand. You give me back all the money, not only a part."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:34:45-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "When the city cancels a class, you're entitled to the refund, so yes, it should be the full amount you paid. I'll just make sure of how it was paid so it goes back the right way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:35:02-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I paid with a check. I brought it here, to the office, in January."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:35:09-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so that would come back as a check from the city. It's processed through the finance office, so it takes a little while. Usually a couple of weeks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:35:23-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A couple of weeks, okay. And it comes to my house, in the mail?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:35:30-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it'll be mailed to the address on your registration. Do you want to make sure we have the right one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:35:40-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, is the same. I did not move. Forty years in the same house. It is fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:35:49-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Then I'll put in the request right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:35:54-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Can I ask, how much was it? The class. I think I remember, but I want to be sure it matches with the check I get."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:36:07-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, let me look. Okay, it shows you paid for the full session, and the amount is right here on the receipt record. I'll read it to you, but I'd say go look at your check stub too. It should match what's on my screen."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:36:28-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, one moment, I have it here. Read to me, please, and I check."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:36:35-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's the session fee for chair yoga, and there's no extra registration charge on it. Does the stub say the same?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:36:45-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes! It is the same. Good, good. I was afraid I wrote the wrong number. My handwriting, it is terrible."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:36:55-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, you're all set, it matches. Now, would you like to switch to something else instead? We've got a few other classes starting in the spring."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:37:07-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, maybe. What do you have? Something gentle, for my knees. I cannot do the floor."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:37:15-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's a gentle stretch and balance class that meets in the afternoons, and I believe there's a walking group that starts when the weather turns. I can mail you the spring brochure."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:37:30-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please, send me the brochure. The walking group, that is good. I like to walk, but not alone when it is icy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:37:41-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Smart. Okay, I'll add you to the brochure mailing. Same address as the registration?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:37:48-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, same. And I want to ask one more thing. I have a rented machine, a carpet cleaner, from the city. I need to bring it back. Today I come this afternoon. Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:38:04-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, the carpet cleaner, yes, we handle those here. You can bring it right to the front desk. We're open until five today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:38:15-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Until five, okay. I come around four, I think. My neighbor, she drives me. So I put the machine in her car, and we come."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:38:27-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works great. Just bring the whole unit, with the hose and the attachments, and the tank empty if you can."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:38:37-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The tank empty, yes. I will empty it in the sink. And the hose, the little brush also. I bring everything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:38:47-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wonderful. Whoever's at the desk will check it in and give you a receipt. Keep that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:38:55-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A receipt, okay. So, I want to confirm. Today I return the machine, and the refund, it goes by check in two weeks, and you send the brochure. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:39:10-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's exactly right. You've got it, Nora."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:39:14-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wonderful. You are very kind, Beth. Everybody here is always so nice with me, even when my English goes in the wrong order."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:39:25-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Your English is great. It was a pleasure talking with you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:39:31-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much. If the check does not come, I call you again, okay? My number you have, it is 401-555-0179."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:39:42-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, I've got that on the request. You have a lovely afternoon, and we'll see you around four."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:39:51-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, see you later. Goodbye, Beth."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T14:39:55-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye now."
    }
  ],
